 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Last week Mrs. Mills went to London.",
   "zh": "上星期米尔斯夫人去了伦敦。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 7.6,
    "end": 11.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "She does not know London very well, and she lost her way.",
   "zh": "她对伦敦不很熟悉，因此迷了路。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 11.4,
    "end": 16.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Suddenly, she saw a man near a bus stop.",
   "zh": "突然，她在公共汽车站附近看到一个男人。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 16.9,
    "end": 21.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'I can ask him the way,' she said to herself.",
   "zh": "“我可以向他问路，”她想。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 21.5,
    "end": 26.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Excuse me,' she said.",
   "zh": "“对不起，”她说。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 26.6,
    "end": 30
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Can you tell me the way to King Street, please?'",
   "zh": "“您能告诉我到国王街怎么走吗？”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 30,
    "end": 34.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The man smiled pleasantly.",
   "zh": "这人友好地笑了笑。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 34.5,
    "end": 37.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He did not understand English!",
   "zh": "他不懂英语！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 37.9,
    "end": 41.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He spoke German.",
   "zh": "他讲德语。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 41.3,
    "end": 43.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He was a tourist.",
   "zh": "他是个旅游者。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 43.8,
    "end": 46.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Then he put his hand into his pocket,",
   "zh": "然后他把手伸进了衣袋，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 46.4,
    "end": 49.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "and took out a phrasebook.",
   "zh": "掏出了一本常用语手册。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 49.8,
    "end": 53
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He opened the book and found a phrase.",
   "zh": "他翻开书找到了一条短语。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 53,
    "end": 57.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He read the phrase slowly.",
   "zh": "他缓慢地读着短语。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 57.2,
    "end": 61.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'I am sorry,' he said.",
   "zh": "“很抱歉，”他说。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 61.2,
    "end": 66
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'I do not speak English.'",
   "zh": "“我不会讲英语。”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L073.mp4",
    "start": 66,
    "end": 72.6
   }
  }
 ],
